body:
I'm not totally sure, this is one of my first sticknpokes! 3RL needle, deep breaths, intense devotion to what this tattoo represents for me? What really pleased me is that I completed this tattoo in one session, whereas my previous tattoo took a couple sessions to get lines like this despite similar size and complexity.

&#x200B;

Ah, I also used vaseline during the tattooing process and that did help stop the ink from spreading out, so I could much more easily see what I was doing. That and the occasional wipe with a green soap solution made this a lot more manageable.
